    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** AS PER INSTRUCTIONS OF THE EXECUTORS **\r\n\r\nWelcome to No.7. Dowling Property is delighted to present to the market, this charming, 3 bedroom, extended home for sale. Tucked away in this quiet cul-de-sac, this fine home is \"chain free\" and is being offered for sale by the original owners from new. The accommodation extends to c.96 sq.mt and features 3 generous sized bedrooms and a real bonus is the extended ground floor which now incorporates a utility and full downstairs bathroom. The heating is gas and the windows are double glazed.\r\n\r\nBoth the front and rear gardens are a real highlight and have been lovingly cared for by its \"green fingere \" owners throughout the years and are bursting with a selection of colourful flowers and shrubs. The rear garden is private and mature and extends to c.22 metres in length. The front is tastefully landscaped and benefits from  gated off-st-parking. The location is simply 1st class with a host of amenities on your doorstep and is just a c.2 minute walk to Bayside Dart station. \r\n\r\nWe must now advise on early viewing to avoid disappointment as this house is one not to be missed !!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation, which is bright and spacious, consists of entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen/breakfast room , utility and downstairs bathroom. Upstairs are 3 generous sized bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are located within a stones throw of your doorstep which include Bayside dart station which is just a c.5 minute walk away with a selection of both primary and secondary schools, childcare, shopping in the Racecourse Shopping Centre with Lidl, pharmacy and coffee/restaurant shop, etc. Baldoyle also boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School. There is a vast array of leisure activities and all just a short distance to the seafront."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 3.81m x 1.81m \r\nA welcoming hallway with understairs storage.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.17m x 3.1m \r\nThis well proportioned sitting room enjoys very pleasant front garden views. Tiled floor, TV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 5.03m x 4.4m \r\nThe heartbeat of this delightful home is this generous sized kitchen/breakfast room. Fitted kitchen with cooker, fridge, dishwasher, tiled floor and door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nExtended Utility Room - 1.9m x 0.87m \r\nWashing machine and tiled floor.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom - 1.96m x 1.92m \r\nA welcome addition to any home is this extended bathroom/wet room. w.c, wash hand basin, tiled floor and walls. \r\n\r\nLanding - 3.52m x 1.84m \r\nGallery staircase.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.8m x 1.91m \r\nFully tiled floor and walls, bath, w.c and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.73m x 3.11m \r\nDouble bedroom with pleasant rear garden views. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.87m x 2.65m \r\nDouble bedroom with free standing wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.06m x 2.3m \r\nSingle bedroom with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nGarden Front - 16.5m x 5.04m \r\nBeautifully landscaped front garden with mature flowers and shrubs. Laid to lawn fully walled with gated off-st-parking.\r\n\r\nGarden Rear - 22.0m x 5.06m \r\nA real highlight of this fine home is this private rear garden which extends to c.22 metres in length. Lovingly maintained over the years by its \" green fingered \" owners. Fully walled, not overlooked, laid to lawn with a selection of mature flowers and shrubs. Barna shed.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Quiet Cul-De-Sac Location\r\nWonderful Mature Gardens Front and Rear\r\n2 Minute Walk to Bayside Dart\r\nOff-St-Parking\r\nAccom Extends c.96 sq.mt\r\nDouble Glazed Windows\r\nGas Heating\r\nLarge Private Rear Garden Extending c.22 metres\r\nExtended Downstairs Bathroom & Utility\r\nChain Free Sale\r\nBER D2\r\nAll Amenities On Your Doorstep"
      },
      {
